    "detailed_description": "KITS is a little showcase of some of the amazing 3D artwork and music that talented people around us are creating. KITS turns their works into fun, engaging, and beautiful little puzzles for all to enjoy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/4bd44d97460338766a8ed72a4a7b9e5c.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/6e0c3603bf81dde45e4ddcd5eccd9721.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/32f9d9485ecdf02ee27333217e191238.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/773763bde8d9d6515c1ad8d607f1dbfb.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/3aa0b508a3c40ab7a11e5db0eb62838c.webp?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br>Use the guide... or the hints... or not.  You can figure it out.<br><br>Once complete, sit back and admire the result, maybe find a welcome surprise or two.<br><br>Then bust it up and try with more pieces this time. Perhaps a higher challenge level. Follow your mood.<br><br>KITS comes from the love of puzzles, models, and how darn cute small things can be.  KITS is still growing and adapting, so share your own ideas or works, and come join the fun!",
    "about_the_game": "KITS is a little showcase of some of the amazing 3D artwork and music that talented people around us are creating. KITS turns their works into fun, engaging, and beautiful little puzzles for all to enjoy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/4bd44d97460338766a8ed72a4a7b9e5c.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/6e0c3603bf81dde45e4ddcd5eccd9721.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/32f9d9485ecdf02ee27333217e191238.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/773763bde8d9d6515c1ad8d607f1dbfb.avif?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331370/extras/3aa0b508a3c40ab7a11e5db0eb62838c.webp?t=1711745146\" /></span><br><br>Use the guide... or the hints... or not.  You can figure it out.<br><br>Once complete, sit back and admire the result, maybe find a welcome surprise or two.<br><br>Then bust it up and try with more pieces this time. Perhaps a higher challenge level. Follow your mood.<br><br>KITS comes from the love of puzzles, models, and how darn cute small things can be.  KITS is still growing and adapting, so share your own ideas or works, and come join the fun!",
